4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=co_OxEi4Gi0Q7kNvwHK8Az9&_nc_oc=AdoxSRIe22R9kG3gr8Cf8_77PXRfIQVnJlA4bii73DeA4JP9u6izjP8yZe2b1fApZnM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD9t6Ow-60uqKMrghBLvqDKc8GRJ2I7xd8sEhNcX4-uEQ&oe=6A5F6E54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o2olnCn6E_MQ7kNvwE9ecdE&_nc_oc=AdpzsnKo3oSDKRKLujxq6wmW6JmO0WQQjPKFmeVrEC0ysRAzqV-pOxmTRME47e0KUFc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB6Hmryrh9_LmMfs2m6fSZTaqEd4m0kUt3UIHPHV6oNGg&oe=6A5F7332"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_JCNL103j7sQ7kNvwG6bnSc&_nc_oc=Adq4murqvyHsDbnFj2bqL6Flqk4FGfQFwoInSGMontTfkQz7Enp_pw1H0QMiv_q3SzI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDqsS4ZHJTentOIyxM_Aa1BdimIPBo-Y1AxIP6scF-xRw&oe=6A5F80D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p